1
00:00:00,541 --> 00:00:01,333
Exactly, Governor.

2
00:00:01,333 --> 00:00:02,708
I know my own son best.

3
00:00:03,083 --> 00:00:04,875
How could a miner who spends his days 

4
00:00:04,875 --> 00:00:06,791
digging rocks possibly be the Godfather?

5
00:00:07,041 --> 00:00:10,083
The Sovereign Sanctum is a place of supreme dignity.

6
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:13,125
How could the great Godfather be nothing but a miner?

7
00:00:13,625 --> 00:00:14,000
Severin, 

8
00:00:14,625 --> 00:00:16,583
if you still have any dignity left,

9
00:00:17,916 --> 00:00:20,000
apologize to the Governor right now.

10
00:00:21,041 --> 00:00:22,750
Livia, you really are stupid.

11
00:00:23,708 --> 00:00:24,500
Look at them.

12
00:00:24,625 --> 00:00:27,458
 Lord Campbell of Black Raven City, Elowen Morellan,

13
00:00:27,458 --> 00:00:28,666
heir of the Morellan family.

14
00:00:29,125 --> 00:00:31,125
All of them are far greater than you,

15
00:00:31,458 --> 00:00:33,708
and they all answer to me.

16
00:00:35,583 --> 00:00:39,916
Do you really think people like them would be fooled so easily?

17
00:00:41,541 --> 00:00:43,791
Who knows what kind of sorcery you used.

18
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:45,833
If you were really the Godfather,

19
00:00:46,291 --> 00:00:48,708
why would you willingly live as a lowly miner?

20
00:00:48,958 --> 00:00:50,916
I don’t believe a single word you say.

21
00:01:03,125 --> 00:01:06,375
I present the national treasure of Aspelta,

22
00:01:06,791 --> 00:01:10,000
the Star Crown of Mystic Crystal, to the Godfather.

23
00:01:10,666 --> 00:01:12,500
Congratulations on your wedding, my lord.

24
00:01:16,791 --> 00:01:18,083
Thank your father for me.

25
00:01:18,958 --> 00:01:21,791
It is a great privilege to see you in person.

26
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:24,791
My duty is done.

27
00:01:26,833 --> 00:01:27,916
I will take my leave.

28
00:01:30,333 --> 00:01:34,291
This ring can only be worn by the

29
00:01:34,291 --> 00:01:36,291
woman who will stand by my side 

30
00:01:38,125 --> 00:01:39,333
for the rest of my life.

31
00:01:39,916 --> 00:01:41,000
Elowen Morellan, 

32
00:01:41,291 --> 00:01:42,875
 will you be my one and only wife?

33
00:01:44,291 --> 00:01:45,000
I will.
